        </p>

      </div>


      <div class="newsletter-deconstruction">

        <div class="newsletter-deconstruction__visual">

          <img
            src="/images/newsletters/casestudy.webp"
            alt="Annotated Schneider Electric newsletter"
            loading="lazy"
          />

        </div>


        <div class="newsletter-deconstruction__content">

          <article>
            <span>01</span>

            <div>
              <h3>Lead story</h3>
              <p>
                Highest visual prominence given to the update with the
                strongest relevance for the month.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article>
            <span>02</span>

            <div>
              <h3>Secondary updates</h3>
              <p>
                Supporting activities grouped without competing with the
                primary story.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article>
            <span>03</span>

            <div>
              <h3>Image selection</h3>
              <p>
                Photos used as evidence of activity while maintaining
                enough visual variety across the issue.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article>
            <span>04</span>

            <div>
              <h3>Body copy</h3>
              <p>
                Technical and internal information compressed into short,
