              </p>
            </div>
          </article>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>



    <!-- =====================================================
         07 — DISTRIBUTION
    ====================================================== -->

    <section class="newsletter-section shell">

      <div class="section-heading">

        <p class="eyebrow">
          Schneider Electric / Distribution
        </p>

        <div class="section-rule">
          <span>⌁</span>
        </div>

      </div>


      <div class="newsletter-section__intro">

        <h2 class="display">
          Beyond the<br />
          <span>Issue.</span>
        </h2>

        <p>
          Each issue was distributed across multiple internal communities,
