        </p>

      </div>


      <div class="newsletter-metrics">

        <article>
          <strong>12+</strong>
          <span>Recurring editions</span>
        </article>

        <article>
          <strong>8+</strong>
          <span>Internal communities</span>
        </article>

        <article>
          <strong>20+</strong>
          <span>Stakeholders tagged</span>
